 "description": "Kosiuk2015-Geometric analysis of the Goldbeter minimal model for the embryonic cell cycle\nBioModels BIOMD0000000933 (curated). SBML file: Kosiuk2015.xml.\nSimulation: 0 to 40 time units (SED-ML: Kosiuk2015.sedml), sampling 0.4.\nRun switches: -ig:mass -INT:1 -obeymaxint\nVerification against libRoadRunner (SBML reference): PASS, max |difference| = 6.19e-07 of species peak (worst: C)\nSBML time units are used unchanged as Kintecus seconds.\nConversion notes:\n  [info] Production_of_Cyclin term 3/3: rate order differs from the stoichiometry; consumed on separate line(s) - C: zero order, signed\n  [info] Cdc2_kinase_activation term 2/3: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] Cdc2_kinase_activation term 3/3: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] activation_of_cyclin_protease term 2/3: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] activation_of_cyclin_protease term 3/3: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\nRenamed species (Kintecus name = SBML id): M1 = M",
